    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 57 East Courtyard is a beautifully presented and exceptionally spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment, perched in a prime position on the corner of the third floor of this well-maintained block, within the popular Tullyvale development in Cabinteely, Dublin 18.\nApproximately 80sqm (862sqft) of well-designed, turn-key accommodation benefits from a unique positioning, with a triple aspect and an excellent sunny Southerly facing balcony to provide serene, sweeping views over Killiney, Bray Head, and right across the coastline. A significant highlight of this meticulously maintained property. In the mornings, sunrise can be viewed either from directly inside the property or out on the balcony, further showcasing that No. 57 East Courtyard is truly one of the best placed units within the entire development.\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a spacious hallway that leads to the light-filled open plan living / dining room with our feature balcony, an ideal space for both evening relaxation and entertaining alike. Tucked away in the corner is a Viessmann gas boiler that was installed in recent years as a heating upgrade by the current owners. A fully fitted kitchen with floor to ceiling windows provides modern appliances throughout and excellent storage with its ample presses and units. The other side of the hallway brings us to two generously sized double bedrooms that face out onto the peaceful, landscaped gardens of the courtyard. The main bedroom features an en-suite, and a modern family bathroom, storage room and a hot press complete the internal accommodation.\nThe location of 57 East Courtyard is exceptionally convenient, in this much sought after and well-maintained development. Residents can avail of the on-site creche, leisure centre with gym, swimming pool, sauna and steam room for a nominal annual fee, and the unit also comes with a designated underground parking space that's location will allow for an EV charging point to be installed if required, subject to relevant approval from the management company. Further to this, additional car park space is available to either rent per month, or purchase if desired, from the OMC. Tullvvale is a well-established residential development which is ideally located adjacent to the Cherrywood Business Park. A key feature are the excellent transport links, with the LUAS at Cherrywood just a short stroll away, providing swift access to the city centre and beyond. The nearby N11 with Quality Bus Corridor and the M50 (Junction 15) offer further connectivity. Within easy reach are Cornelscourt, Killiney, and Shankill villages for local amenities such as supermarkets, schools, cafés and restaurants. The development will also benefit from the new Cherrywood Village currently under construction nearby, which will offer wonderful parkland amenities and heritage trails as well as a retail centre.\nOverall, No. 57 East Courtyard offers an exceptional opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, and those looking acquire a spacious turn-key apartment in an area with the most excellent connectivity in Dublin 18."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nEngineered wood flooring, storage room, hot press, radiator\n\nOpen Plan Living / Dining - \nEngineered wood flooring, decorative fireplace, box window, archway to kitchen, radiator, curtains, door leading to south-facing balcony with sea view\n\nKitchen - \nTiled flooring, wood effect wall and floor units, fitted presses, cupboards, stainless steel sink unit, Zanussi oven, Creda gas cooker, large floor to ceiling windows, blinds\n\nMain Bedroom - \nBright and spacious double bedroom, courtyard aspect, fitted wardrobe, double box window, grey carpet,\n\nEn-Suite - \nWC, WHB\n\nBedroom 2 - \nBright and spacious double bedroom, courtyard aspect, box window, curtains, grey carpet\n\nBathroom - \nTiled walls & flooring, WHB, WC, shower, bathtub, mirror\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Bright and spacious two-bedroom, two-bathroom apartment located in a prime position on the corner of the third floor offering a triple aspect</li><li></li><li>Seaside views all the way out to Bray Head from one of the best balcony aspects in the entire development</li><li></li><li>Turn-key condition</li><li></li><li>Approximately 80 sqm (862sqft)</li><li></li><li>Private, designated underground car park space</li><li></li><li>Fitted wardrobes and en-suite in main bedroom</li><li></li><li>Excellent connectivity via M50, Cherrywood Luas and the N11 with QBC</li><li></li><li>On site creche, gym and swimming pool available for residents (nominal cost for gym/pool membership)</li><li>Management fee approx. 2,047 p.a.</li><li></li><li>Kairos Property Management</ul>"
      },
